{"product_id":"i-am-peter-peter-rabbit-animation","title":"I Am Peter (Peter Rabbit Animation)","description":"\u003cp\u003eMeet the newly animated Peter Rabbit! Donned in his father's blue coat, Peter is as frisky and adventurous as ever. His mother has given him his father's old journal--full of adventure stories, secret escape routes, and empty pages for Peter to fill in himself. This classic rabbit, along with his best friends, Lily Bobtail and Benjamin Bunny, is ready for another adventure!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 162 x 235\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Frederick Warne\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780141350042\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738316365977,"sku":"15RE-59780141350042","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ca621e96fe5_I_Am_Peter__Peter_Rabbit_Animation__Frederick_Warne.jpg?v=1758563851","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/i-am-peter-peter-rabbit-animation","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}